 "items": [
  {
   "id": 72907,
   "url": "https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/2026/07/24/kikugawahanabi-2/",
   "date": "2026-07-24",
   "title": "【下関市】4000＋1発に込めた、菊川の意地。「菊川夏まつり花火大会」が7月25日開催。",
   "html": "<div id=\"attachment_72924\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72924\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72924\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/7ff2567330d91a01325ea7234f8d2996.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/7ff2567330d91a01325ea7234f8d2996.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/7ff2567330d91a01325ea7234f8d2996-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72924\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影</p></div>\n<p>4000＋1発。<span style=\"font-size: 11pt\">その「1発」には、菊川の人たちの誇りと意地が込められています。</span></p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72921\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72921\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72921\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/b791d82befac415e891c0b6301e1c7b4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/b791d82befac415e891c0b6301e1c7b4.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/b791d82befac415e891c0b6301e1c7b4-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72921\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影</p></div>\n<p>2026年7月25日（土）に開催される「菊川夏まつり花火大会」の打ち上げ数は4001発。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72916\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72916\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72916\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/96de4dece19a870d49031090702fadf5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/96de4dece19a870d49031090702fadf5.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/96de4dece19a870d49031090702fadf5-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72916\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・花火大会となる菊川の河川敷</p></div>\n<p>2026年の山口県内では、4000発規模の花火大会が複数開催されます。その中で、菊川は県内単独3位となる4001発を打ち上げるのだそう。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72914\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72914\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72914\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/993aaa173682fc8ec1bdb85e981bf354.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/993aaa173682fc8ec1bdb85e981bf354.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/993aaa173682fc8ec1bdb85e981bf354-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72914\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・花火大会となる菊川の河川敷</p></div>\n<p>その1発には、菊川という町の名前を、少しでも多くの人に知ってもらいたい。そんな地域の誇りと意地が込められているように感じます。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72913\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72913\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72913\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/541706b5100c00f0d66494e951730142.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/541706b5100c00f0d66494e951730142.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/541706b5100c00f0d66494e951730142-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72913\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・花火大会となる菊川の河川敷</p></div>\n<p>花火の打ち上げ場所は、アブニール菊川の隣を流れる川沿い。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72911\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72911\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72911\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/a7faa80970fd81facfaa2d609846ebc2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/a7faa80970fd81facfaa2d609846ebc2.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/a7faa80970fd81facfaa2d609846ebc2-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72911\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・花火大会となる菊川の河川敷</p></div>\n<p>打ち上げ場所との距離が非常に近いことも、この花火大会ならではの魅力だといいます。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72912\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72912\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72912\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/e6d9ba24b9d99211ac76a9edb1bc3377.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/e6d9ba24b9d99211ac76a9edb1bc3377.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/e6d9ba24b9d99211ac76a9edb1bc3377-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72912\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・花火大会の会場周辺の様子</p></div>\n<p>花火の魅力は、光と音。頭上いっぱいに咲く大輪の花火と、ドーンと体を揺らす轟音。その臨場感は、思わず首が痛くなるほどの近さだからこそと言えるのではないでしょうか。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72922\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72922\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72922\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/b8ed61f12f783e98ca10a3f494388262.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/b8ed61f12f783e98ca10a3f494388262.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/b8ed61f12f783e98ca10a3f494388262-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72922\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・提灯山笠</p></div>\n<p>そして、この花火大会のもう一つの見どころが、提灯山笠。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72909\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72909\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72909\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/e0c672eb30afe1a807e1e4d50b32c41a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/e0c672eb30afe1a807e1e4d50b32c41a.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/e0c672eb30afe1a807e1e4d50b32c41a-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72909\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・提灯山笠</p></div>\n<p>地域の小中学生と地元の皆さんが力を合わせて制作した提灯山笠が、夏の夜にやさしく輝いています。地域の人と人とのつながりを映しているような優しい明かりです。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_66013\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-66013\" class=\"size-full wp-image-66013\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2025/04/430bf4fae2261039c9d61d589f1690fa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"851\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2025/04/430bf4fae2261039c9d61d589f1690fa.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2025/04/430bf4fae2261039c9d61d589f1690fa-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-66013\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2024年撮影・かむかむさんの入口付近の様子</p></div>\n<p>当日は、菊川食堂かむかむさんも、夜営業を予定するとの事。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72920\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72920\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72920\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/SHANTHIMUSICLIVE.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/SHANTHIMUSICLIVE.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/SHANTHIMUSICLIVE-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72920\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・SHANTHIMUSICLIVEで撮影</p></div>\n<p>店先ではストリートピアノやストリートLIVEも開催予定で、食事や音楽を楽しみながら花火を眺められる、夏ならではの特別な時間が過ごせそうです。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72919\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72919\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72919\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/SHANTHIMUSICLIVE-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/SHANTHIMUSICLIVE-4.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/SHANTHIMUSICLIVE-4-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72919\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・SHANTHIMUSICLIVEで撮影</p></div>\n<p>かむかむさん前は、花火を楽しめる人気スポットの一つとしても知られています。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72908\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72908\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72908\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/ac3d9de830cba8febe7e62c1a330ba7d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/ac3d9de830cba8febe7e62c1a330ba7d.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/ac3d9de830cba8febe7e62c1a330ba7d-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72908\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2025年7月撮影・提灯山笠</p></div>\n<p>夜空に咲く最後の1発は、菊川という町の名前を、誰かの夏の記憶に残すための一発なのかもしれません。</p>\n"
  },
  {
   "id": 72566,
   "url": "https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/2026/07/08/yosimo/",
   "date": "2026-07-08",
   "title": "【下関市】胸にぶつかる夏を感じる。7/25・黒嶋観音夏祭り開催",
   "html": "<div id=\"attachment_72583\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72583\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72583\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/e2b97f7b7dcf046ce41104b5e70e470a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/e2b97f7b7dcf046ce41104b5e70e470a.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/e2b97f7b7dcf046ce41104b5e70e470a-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72583\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影</p></div>\n<p>国道191号線から、吉母入口交差点を曲がり、車を走らせると、たどり着く本州最西端の漁港、吉母漁港。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72576\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72576\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72576\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/a54f1126fe1c3adf315d17d04cd11cf0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"927\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/a54f1126fe1c3adf315d17d04cd11cf0.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/a54f1126fe1c3adf315d17d04cd11cf0-768x556.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72576\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">資料提供：吉母黒嶋観音夏祭り実行委員会</p></div>\n<p>そのすぐそばにある恵比寿神社特設会場（吉母漁協横）で、2026年7月25日（土）18:30から「黒嶋観音夏祭り」が開催されます。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72575\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72575\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72575\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/c5379c63a9baebf7159ce82af1e0ef04.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/c5379c63a9baebf7159ce82af1e0ef04.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/c5379c63a9baebf7159ce82af1e0ef04-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72575\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母自治連合会長清田さんと、民宿立石のおかみさん</p></div>\n<p>吉母に住む人たちが長年大切にしてきた、恵比寿神社をお祀りする、歴史ある地域のお祭り。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72585\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72585\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72585\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/25bdc85abe21dd50e20a1e1252f64c7f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/25bdc85abe21dd50e20a1e1252f64c7f.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/25bdc85abe21dd50e20a1e1252f64c7f-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72585\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母漁港</p></div>\n<p>大きな会場で行われる華やかなイベントとは違い、吉母で暮らす人たちが地域を一軒一軒歩き、寄付を募りながら、今日までつないできた大切なお祭りです。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72582\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72582\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72582\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/3fd2eb55cac83c44f09a76dde03e706c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/3fd2eb55cac83c44f09a76dde03e706c.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/3fd2eb55cac83c44f09a76dde03e706c-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72582\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母自治連合会長清田さん</p></div>\n<p>吉母の自治連合会長・清田さんのお話では、100年以上続く鎮守のお祭りが、黒嶋観音夏祭りとなって、今年で35回目だといいます。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72578\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72578\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72578\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/c8f0680d092fd387c18267b810f8a181.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/c8f0680d092fd387c18267b810f8a181.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/c8f0680d092fd387c18267b810f8a181-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72578\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母漁港の風景</p></div>\n<p>このお祭りに足を運ぶと、きっと感じる、祭り本来の意味。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72569\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72569\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72569\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/6de65e229c7c9453815c3412fa2f38eb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/6de65e229c7c9453815c3412fa2f38eb.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/6de65e229c7c9453815c3412fa2f38eb-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72569\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影、下関の花・はまゆうが咲く吉母漁港の風景</p></div>\n<p>土地の神様をお祀りし、暮らしへの感謝や、地域の安寧を願って、人が集まり、顔を合わせ、同じ時間を過ごす。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72567\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72567\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72567\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/0eb8d3daf0cdf02c595ca5dd323fd324.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/0eb8d3daf0cdf02c595ca5dd323fd324.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/0eb8d3daf0cdf02c595ca5dd323fd324-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72567\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影・まつり会場</p></div>\n<p>祭り当日は、清流太鼓やよさこい、生バンド演奏などで、いつもは静かな吉母の港が賑わいを見せます。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72584\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72584\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72584\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/25e35b2c50b9ec33c15c9fa2eded08c4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/25e35b2c50b9ec33c15c9fa2eded08c4.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/25e35b2c50b9ec33c15c9fa2eded08c4-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72584\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母漁港</p></div>\n<p>時代とともに、祭りの形は少しずつ変わっても、人が集まり、音が響き、笑顔が生まれる風景は変わりません。きっとそれが、遠い昔から受け継がれてきた夏祭りの温かさなのではないでしょうか。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72568\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72568\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72568\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/39ce8389d5111cc4baa0fb710f21cbf3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/39ce8389d5111cc4baa0fb710f21cbf3.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/39ce8389d5111cc4baa0fb710f21cbf3-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72568\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母漁港の風景</p></div>\n<p>そして、21：00に迎える、祭りのフィナーレ。吉母の人たちが、胸を張って自慢する打ち上げ花火。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72579\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72579\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72579\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/07eb1c255585e76a1f70f476bc8767c2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/07eb1c255585e76a1f70f476bc8767c2.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/07eb1c255585e76a1f70f476bc8767c2-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72579\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母漁港の風景</p></div>\n<p>すぐそばの堤防から打ち上がるという花火は、ドン、と胸に、空気の塊がぶつかるくらいの迫力だといいます。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72574\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72574\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72574\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/065e6979c4fb8b3f60d2971187b08ed7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/065e6979c4fb8b3f60d2971187b08ed7.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/065e6979c4fb8b3f60d2971187b08ed7-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72574\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母の海</p></div>\n<p>花火が上がるたび、夜空の光に照らされる、幾つもの夏を越えてきた地元の人の少年や少女のような笑顔。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72572\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72572\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72572\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/9e763aa4536868fdd364766981291a55.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/9e763aa4536868fdd364766981291a55.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/9e763aa4536868fdd364766981291a55-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72572\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影・駐車可能スペース</p></div>\n<p>吉母の人の自慢の花火を見た人の中には、受付で「来年の花火のために」と、そっと寄付を置いて帰る人もいるそうです。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72571\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72571\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72571\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/8fe3313258295fd730d77dbaaca9f72b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/8fe3313258295fd730d77dbaaca9f72b.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/8fe3313258295fd730d77dbaaca9f72b-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72571\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影駐車可能スペース目印</p></div>\n<p>一夜の感動が、また次の夏へつながっていく。それもまた、黒嶋観音夏祭りの大切な風景なのかもしれません。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72570\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72570\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72570\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/bc40e1f55bb2c13a5a17a57a2be0f51e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/bc40e1f55bb2c13a5a17a57a2be0f51e.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/bc40e1f55bb2c13a5a17a57a2be0f51e-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72570\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影駐車可能スペース</p></div>\n<p>神様をおまつりする日。人が集い、笑い、願いをつなぐ日。そして、その夜を締めくくる、胸に響く花火。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72573\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72573\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72573\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/b216a3462d1fe81fec63fa6ae5bf6356.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/b216a3462d1fe81fec63fa6ae5bf6356.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/b216a3462d1fe81fec63fa6ae5bf6356-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72573\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母漁港の風景</p></div>\n<p>今年の夏は、吉母でしか出会えない一夜を過ごしてみてはいかがでしょうか。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_72577\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-72577\" class=\"size-full wp-image-72577\" src=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/658e6422b7fa5c6934f5da49ec4e2f71.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"852\" srcset=\"https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/658e6422b7fa5c6934f5da49ec4e2f71.jpg 1280w, https://shimonoseki.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/64/2026/07/658e6422b7fa5c6934f5da49ec4e2f71-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-72577\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2026年撮影吉母漁港の風景</p></div>\n<p>※当日は空くじなしの抽選券も販売予定とのこと。※また、駐車場は、山口県漁協吉母支店周辺道路が利用できるとのことです。</p>\n<p>恵比寿神社はこちら<div class=\"googlemaps\">\n\t\t\t\t<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\"  src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d7003.062275114588!2d130.89959200309107!3d34.06938083487434!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3543a3db1a41d7d9:0x483aaad1e30d85fb!2z5oG1576O6aCI56We56S-!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1783482315523!5m2!1sja!2sjp\"></iframe>\n\t\t\t</div></p>\n"
  }
